    "SQL-AGG-ORDER"
  ],
  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-FOLD, SQL-AGG-ORDER: What exact Double bits do Sum, Avg and Count give per group over FL and over its indexed copy FLI (g1: one 2^53 then 4096 ones; g2: 4096 ones then one 2^53; g3: 2^53, 4096 ones, -2^53; about 4100 rows each), as GROUP BY g, GROUP BY g ORDER BY g DESC, and as one statement per group with WHERE g = 1, 2, 3? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-fold2 opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
